  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b833d1c7037ffb2ccb59ffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "签纸还是用金光闪闪的最好了！\r\n最帅又最显眼嘛！\r\n这样愿望会更容易实现吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ec85d482a5359aed45307f95ea4765884661ef65248f381d67746c29d74b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:915fd8ecdc6eb546cf598dc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我又不是小鬼，就算拿到点心\r\n也不会特别高兴……但有准备的话\r\n我也是可以收下啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b304b98b60d6b1ddaf6b65ae09c78ea8d333c62aa070799b91dd66978f49d8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf7b3b5313a2a9a316f6e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我们家都说圣诞老人\r\n是骑着红色的摩托车。我好像还曾经\r\n向往过能在天上飞的摩托车呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd715ef4fefcb7ad2d885a5d7ef1152400dd08fa17258f81049ece0f432265a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94f7f6e7fafeb7607e7ab3cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐！我们找个地方去吧。\r\n今天是跟重要的人一起过……\r\n是要跟伙伴一起共度的日子，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d57ae5081cffc35199a26fdf3d8f13ba37b4aa21765b91fc0e1a05e5fba24d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072ab9a3d1b377fa330a5a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b8624abed948d0e6a84b94335e1037decef0acf48c44155fdd86e0f5fcff33b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c1fd86dee9415f0f5e2bb63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天一早我们就出发！\r\n身为一个摩托车手，\r\n怎么能不去看新年的第一个日出呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "438a0ee9af59b8f7f70b557d2435d8c5abc8192fbd50b2d8f857fdfe561c1b6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:449f13fa346eec039f47e868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢，生日啊，恭喜啊。\r\n那我们去吃点什么好吃的吧。\r\n我请客哦，请你喝自助饮料吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2989b07f042f5e3a5b7693f22853f164ee60f48c9df1ebaef4570d61e2ff10ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac307b6c07b30f251b09e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂、喂，今天是你生日吧。\r\n呃……我有准备蛋糕啦！\r\n你要记得空着肚子等哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e7fc3fcf2014669de230e14f23dfd0fc00094a0739351225c17f9d1099debc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76031bfceb457dd7a29ab4a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日！\r\n我又要变得更成熟、更帅了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba499e00a032a8e5880ff076b1dd062a6a27ce4c98d36392db62eb17994c1fc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c86ee190fcebc3745fa39d79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啥？要出门庆祝我的生日！？\r\n不用啦！这样太羞耻了！\r\n顶、顶多跟你一起吃个蛋糕就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1589b0396fb5a3f9883a262d1e3e16dedbd06ff582cbb8e69bcaebcb0f4b4093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:986fb7026779bd45634564c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有什么新公告哦。\r\n就交给你去确认了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c98de07f57779b53b9278368ba717a0b00e93bb700e4eba02d3bbfbbb8cd2f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89b5c9063ccc701d74931d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦！有礼物送来了耶！\r\n是什么是什么？也让我一起看啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b6ea649b443d393f304e637998dc45581e475fa5defbb478e3cf5dd0c31847",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5871867910410dd5f5749c35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很棒嘛，你好像达成目标了哦！\r\n真不愧是我的伙伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "493a4f07d80b633bbd36cc38a9adfcd9f1342f99d8bdc1ffbf59fee7cd4ef202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3d7bdb773127cac51bdfb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在准备要办什么活动。\r\n希望会是帅气的那种～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f13d86d2369c52b8264e30b369f506b2a85a50f3b917500368d88bf0b466a7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ed33d11dcd0f73b0fb3e3c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动啊！\r\n比任何人都更活跃的……\r\n当然会是我们！没错吧？嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f694f748f121cf29750df2cb2e1e4830d8653d34ffcd3ac1e3d7aed637a24d53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eef832a4fd79a5d5d250c33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "输了ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "324bbd1cefd9e601c947217fc0788d39c72292732ebd7d2f3d501f88084f892e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:386a1b5435d7b8da7d37c079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c551ae4e0937453991acea61d5d5b51ef9d85d35d685fd0fea9ce35bc808760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d5ae9c58020de50ebcb441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说皮衣跟牛仔外套都会\r\n越穿越有味道喔。嘿嘿，\r\n我要把自己的历史刻进服装里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c8ee5c9d361da611c7b8526a4d30f816dd170682f5d75baf0a84fb527f85e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ba483a32eaee1edf08df95e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在的LANE图示是穿着这身衣服\r\n坐在咖啡厅吧台的照片喔。\r\n很性格吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eea41a6620aba779e52e659d8880ac1a2f034fd9fe8edeee6dfa3791ee26b0d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a66ac018c164f129b07e6ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之前看了部电影，\r\n主角骑的摩托车真的有够帅气～！\r\n我超想要那台车的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f76b17552ca9f580f284c22cfb041afadfb1ce83689d4e4ee04f6d6131cca656",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089bf78bc840118ca16b1cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是场很棒的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd83ee410e15f1eacec462edba253b0d05ba87153129ceb6926b0daaee3868a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c49fe844d177b0504f9447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢得非常漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7393f088d44c35d6d59e3c00c7870d3f57fd0c16d3f273d50a69c4991b0f231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
